{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33989","headline":"醉中偶作呈鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"醉中偶作呈鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谿云涧鸟本吾侪，刚爲浮名事事乖。\n十里寻山爲思役，五更看月是情差。\n分将吟咏华双鬓，力以壶觞固百骸。\n争得草堂归卧去，共君同作太常斋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}